  ----------------------------------------------------------------------
  3. LICENCE TIERS
  ----------------------------------------------------------------------

  The number of Authorized Deployments and the scope of permitted
  white-labelling depend on the tier purchased:

    (a) Hosted Licence — the Licensor hosts the Software for Licensee on a
        subscription or lifetime-account basis. No Source Code is provided.
        Usage is subject to the then-current hosted usage limits.

    (b) Agency Source Licence — Licensee receives Source Code and may operate
        ONE (1) Authorized Deployment. Unlimited internal team members.
        Client-Facing Materials may be fully white-labelled. Licensee may
        charge clients for audits and related services. Source Code may be
        modified for internal use but NOT redistributed or resold.

    (c) Studio Licence — Licensee receives Source Code and may operate up to
        FIVE (5) Authorized Deployments across multiple agency brands, for
        controlled client deployments. Source Code may NOT be publicly
        redistributed. Sublicensing is not permitted unless separately
        authorized in writing by the Licensor.

  The default tier governing this repository when distributed in source form
  is the Agency Source Licence, unless a signed order document states
  otherwise.

